      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux utiliser cet Holoporteur ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020007500740069006C0069007300650072002000630065007400200048006F006C006F0070006F007200740065007500720020003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas de chance ! Il est hors service jusqu’à ce que\nj’aie terminé la maintenance.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais là, je suis en pause, et la pause ça passe\navant tout.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, puisque j’ai du temps, ça te dirait\nde faire un combat ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044201900610069006C006C0065007500720073002C002000700075006900730071007500650020006A201900610069002000640075002000740065006D00700073002C002000E700610020007400650020006400690072006100690074000A0064006500200066006100690072006500200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740020003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si t’acceptes, je me remettrai au boulot illico,\net tu pourras utiliser l’Holoporteur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens me voir si tu veux te battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007300690020007400750020007600650075007800200074006500200062006100740074007200650020002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On se fait un combat ? Je me remettrai au boulot\njuste après et tu pourras accéder à l’Holoporteur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais gagner fissa !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000760061006900730020006700610067006E00650072002000660069007300730061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je refuse.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007200650066007500730065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK. Je continue ma pause, alors.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002E0020004A006500200063006F006E00740069006E007500650020006D0061002000700061007500730065002C00200061006C006F00720073002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ouais ? C’est ce qu’on va voir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680020006F00750061006900730020003F0020004320190065007300740020006300650020007100752019006F006E00200076006100200076006F006900720020002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, je vais pas pouvoir réparer cet\nHoloporteur au milieu d’une zone de combat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour ce combat ! Tu as mis fin à ma pause\nen deux temps, trois capacités...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, hop ! Je vais terminer le taf vite fait,\nbien fait !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C00200068006F0070002000210020004A0065002000760061006900730020007400650072006D0069006E006500720020006C006500200074006100660020007600690074006500200066006100690074002C000A006200690065006E002000660061006900740020002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La maintenance est terminée !\nTu peux maintenant utiliser l’Holoporteur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au fait, tous les Pokémon que j’ai utilisés pendant\nnotre combat proviennent des toits de la ville !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je profite de mes heures de travail pour essayer\nde capturer des Pokémon, héhé.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAujourd’hui, j’étais tellement à fond que j’ai failli\nrater l’heure de la pause !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toi aussi, tu devrais visiter les toits.\nTu y trouveras plein de Pokémon à capturer !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as vu ? Quand je m’y mets, je travaille\nsuper vite !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00542019006100730020007600750020003F0020005100750061006E00640020006A00650020006D201900790020006D006500740073002C0020006A00650020007400720061007600610069006C006C0065000A00730075007000650072002000760069007400650020002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
